(* Variant mimic-none: the session with a Login over the mimic transport, as the code has it, against an attacker that is
   the network and knows the public key of the server (AUD-7, #425). This is the prober: it sends what it likes to the
   REALITY listener and sees what comes back, and without a short id of the server it is spliced to the decoy. The Noise
   handshake is bound to the exporter of the REALITY session, which the first line of the stream carries. *)

process
  ( Setup()
  | MimicSetup()
  | MimicSessions(bt_export, kp_on)
  )
